@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam component {
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DiamondBorderColor #F97316
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
}
skinparam partition {
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

start
:接收学习证据\n资源学习、测验、章节作业、代码题、5E互动;
:按课程节点和章节聚合证据;
if (证据是否有效?) then (无效)
  :记录缺失原因\n未布置、未采集、未完成、样本少;
  :不生成强诊断;
else (有效)
  :计算知识点掌握度;
  :计算学习投入、测验表现、学习稳定性;
  :读取章节作业和代码题形成章节综合实践能力;
endif
:生成学生画像快照;
:输出学生端说明、教师端证据下钻、诊断输入;
stop
@enduml
